5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a logical way to handle the shortage. I'll check the five years of association minutes and last year's complaint log entries to see how this was handled before.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I want to make sure everyone is treated fairly! I'll look into the sticker register and the daily riders, and also the morning departures watched from the entrance.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I'll look into the rain exposure along the parking rows and the morning departures watched from the entrance to understand the physical layout and usage.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll handle the financial side since no one ever seems to. I'll check the building account's two-year ledger and the treasurer's handover file on cash collections.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll look into the account from the neighbouring block's secretary and the treasurer's handover file on cash collections to see how other associations manage the workload.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
